@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "Cliente Web / Postman" as C
component "Spring Security" as Sec
component "JwtFilter + JwtService" as Jwt
component "8 Controllers REST" as Ctrl
component "Services: Auth, Admin, Doacao,
Requisicao, Organizacao, Usuario,
Voluntario, Dashboard" as Svc
component "ImpactoAlimentarCalculator" as Calc
component "Spring Data Repositories" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL
JPA / JSONB" as DB
C --> Sec
Sec --> Jwt
Sec --> Ctrl
Ctrl --> Svc
Svc --> Calc
Svc --> Repo
Repo --> DB
note right of Jwt
TEMP e ACCESS têm escopos diferentes.
Autenticação não garante isolamento
horizontal sem checagem do serviço.
end note
@enduml
